# Hulkling, Burgeoning Bruiser: "Whenever another creature you control enters, if it has greater power or toughness than Hulkling, put a
# +1/+1 counter on Hulkling." Hulkling is a 2/3. A Grizzly Bears (2/2: neither greater) gives nothing; a Sylvan Caryatid (0/3: equal
# toughness, lesser power) gives nothing; a Centaur Courser (3/3: greater power only) gives a counter (3/4); a second Courser (3/3: equal
# power, lesser toughness) gives none; a Wall of Ice (0/7: greater toughness only) gives another (4/5). Bot2's Centaur Courser (not
# Bot1's creature) gives none either.

